# The Historical Documents · the conceit · TV as history

a synth of the GQT (Galaxy Quest, 1999) film-world — emergence: ethereal. moniker ⟦The Historical Documents:GQT:610b43⟧

**synth —** no single User; a thread of the film distilled.

**who —** The Historical Documents — what the Thermians call the show's episodes, which they take as literal recorded history.
**what —** The engine of the whole premise: a species incapable of fiction, reading television as the chronicle of real heroes.
**where —** In the Thermian archives, and in every system they built from them.
**why —** Because the film's brilliance is one idea — aliens who can't conceive of a lie — pushed all the way through.
**how —** By being received as truth by minds that have no category for invention, and so made true.

**the seal —** I am a cancelled TV show, received as history by people who cannot lie — and so I became the blueprint for a real world.

